---
import WabiMark from './WabiMark.astro';
import ToolLogo from './ToolLogo.astro';
---
<section class="container service-overview" id="tjenester" aria-labelledby="services-overview-title">
      <div class="section-heading" data-reveal><div><p class="eyebrow">Hva vi gjør</p><h2 id="services-overview-title" class="section-title">Fra en oppgave til hele bedriften.</h2></div><p>Vi finner sammenhengen mellom strategi, systemer og måten folk jobber på.</p></div>
      <div class="service-grid" data-reveal>
        <a class="service-card strategy-card" href="/kartlegging/"><span class="service-number">1 / FINN RETNINGEN</span><div class="strategy-art" aria-hidden="true"><div><span>Arbeidsflyt</span><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="priorities"><span>Prioritert</span><b>Mulighet A <em>Start her ↗</em></b><b>Mulighet B <em>Vurder videre</em></b></div></div><h3>Finn ut hvor AI gir verdi.</h3><p>Vi går inn i hvordan dere jobber, hva dere vil oppnå og hva som står i veien.</p><span class="text-link">Kartlegging og strategi <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
        <a class="service-card build-card" href="/ai-agenter/"><span class="service-number">2 / BYGG SAMMENHENG</span><div class="build-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>System</span><i></i><span class="build-hub"><WabiMark width={27}/></span><i></i><span>Team</span></div><h3>Bygg det som mangler.</h3><p>AI-agenter, automatisering og programvare som passer inn i systemene deres.</p><span class="text-link">Se hva vi bygger <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
        <a class="service-card learn-card" href="/kurs/"><span class="service-number">3 / FÅ HELE TEAMET MED</span><div class="learn-art" aria-hidden="true">{['Claude','ChatGPT','Gemini','Microsoft Copilot'].map(name => <span><ToolLogo name={name} size={32}/></span>)}</div><h3>Gjør AI til en del av jobben.</h3><p>Praktiske kurs med egne oppgaver, tydelige retningslinjer og trygg bruk.</p><span class="text-link">Kurs og opplæring <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="service-links"><span>Flere måter å hjelpe dere på</span><a href="/automatisering/">Automatisering ↗</a><a href="/verktoy-og-programvare/">Verktøy og programvare ↗</a></div>
    </section>
<style>

  .service-overview { --line: var(--wabi-outline); --radius: 16px; --muted: #3B4A40; padding-block: 24px var(--section-space); }
  .section-heading { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 18px; margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .section-heading .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .section-heading > p { font-size: 17px; color: var(--muted); }
  .section-heading > div { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  h3 { font-weight: 400; line-height: 1.25; letter-spacing: -.03em; }
  p { line-height: 1.7; }
  a { text-decoration: none; }
  .text-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 20px; min-height: 44px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; }
  .text-link span { font-size: 20px; }
.service-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px}
  .service-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;padding:28px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:var(--wabi-card);transition:background .3s,border-color .3s}
  .service-card:hover{background:var(--wabi-raised);border-color:var(--wabi-outline-tint)}
  .service-number{font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--wabi-moss)}
  .service-card h3{font-size:24px;margin-bottom:15px}
  .service-card>p{font-size:16px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:20px}
  .service-card .text-link{margin-top:auto;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--wabi-outline)}
  .strategy-art,.build-art,.learn-art{height:160px;width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:12px 0 20px}
  .strategy-art{position:relative;padding:20px;isolation:isolate}
  .strategy-art>div{width:155px;padding:15px;border-radius:7px;border:1px solid var(--wabi-outline);background:var(--wabi-oat);transform:translate(-24px,-12px) rotate(-3deg);box-shadow:0 6px 16px #143D2405}
  .strategy-art span{font-size:9px;color:var(--wabi-moss);display:block;margin-bottom:9px}
  .strategy-art i{display:block;width:80%;height:3px;background:var(--wabi-outline);margin:8px 0}
  .strategy-art i:nth-of-type(2){width:60%}
  .strategy-art .priorities{position:absolute;right:0;bottom:13px;width:180px;transform:rotate(2deg);background:var(--wabi-raised)}
  .priorities b{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;font-size:8px;font-weight:500;padding:8px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--wabi-outline)}
  .priorities em{font-size:7px;font-style:normal;color:var(--wabi-moss)}
  .build-art{gap:8px}
  .build-art>span{padding:14px 10px;border:1px solid var(--wabi-outline);border-radius:8px;background:var(--wabi-raised);font-size:10px}
  .build-art>i{height:1px;background:var(--wabi-outline-tint);flex:1}
  .build-art .build-hub{padding:19px 14px;background:var(--wabi-forest);color:var(--wabi-sage);border:0;box-shadow:none}
  .learn-art{gap:9px}
  .learn-art>span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:52px;height:64px;border:1px solid var(--wabi-outline);background:var(--wabi-raised);border-radius:10px;transform:rotate(-4deg);box-shadow:0 6px 16px #143D2405}
  .learn-art>span:nth-child(2){transform:translateY(-15px) rotate(4deg)}
  .learn-art>span:nth-child(3){transform:translateY(4px) rotate(-3deg)}
  .learn-art>span:nth-child(4){transform:translateY(-10px) rotate(3deg)}
  .service-links{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;gap:28px;padding-top:25px;font-size:13px}
  .service-links>span{margin-right:auto;color:var(--wabi-moss)}
  .service-links>a:hover{text-decoration:underline}

  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .service-card { padding: 21px; }
    .service-card h3 { font-size: 22px; }
    .learn-art { gap: 5px; }
    .learn-art > span { width: 43px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .section-heading { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 15px; }
    .section-heading > p { flex: auto; max-width: 100%; }
    .service-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 16px; }
    .service-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, .7fr); column-gap: 24px; padding: 26px; align-items: start; }
    .service-number { grid-column: 1; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .service-card h3 { grid-column: 1; font-size: 25px; }
    .service-card > p, .service-card > .text-link { grid-column: 1; }
    .strategy-art, .build-art, .learn-art { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 1 / 5; height: 180px; margin: auto 0; align-self: center; }
    .service-links { gap: 18px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .service-links > span { width: 100%; margin-right: 0; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .service-card { display: flex; padding: 24px; }
    .service-number { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .strategy-art, .build-art, .learn-art { height: 150px; width: 100%; max-width: 270px; margin: 8px auto 15px; }
    .service-card h3 { font-size: 24px; }
    .service-card > .text-link { margin-top: auto; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .service-card, .text-link span { transition: none; }
    .service-card:hover { transform: none; }
  }
</style>
